WEBVTT

01:50.060 --> 01:53.920
[Love Between Lines]

01:54.310 --> 01:56.759
[Episode 27]

02:27.500 --> 02:30.630
♪ Midnight ♪

02:32.090 --> 02:36.970
♪ I see stars fly ♪

02:38.760 --> 02:43.500
♪ As they fall to Earth ♪

02:44.990 --> 02:52.220
♪ Lighting up this moment ♪

02:52.990 --> 02:55.310
♪ You outshine the stars ♪

02:56.030 --> 02:58.760
♪ And hold them in your palm ♪

02:59.200 --> 03:02.230
♪ Now we've made a way ♪

03:02.770 --> 03:06.090
♪ Now we're at the edge ♪

03:06.110 --> 03:08.110
♪ Tomorrow and today ♪

03:08.980 --> 03:11.590
♪ Now in every way ♪

03:11.620 --> 03:16.710
♪ The world draws still ♪

03:17.140 --> 03:21.540
♪ I wish for you ♪

03:23.340 --> 03:28.870
♪ I wish for you ♪

03:29.340 --> 03:35.829
♪ Look up at the moon
and reach for my hand ♪

03:35.960 --> 03:39.750
♪ Oh, I wish for you ♪

03:44.250 --> 03:53.600
♪ I've been always chasing ♪

03:55.400 --> 04:00.010
♪ Facing every moment, time after time ♪

04:00.320 --> 04:05.150
♪ You bring me to life again ♪

04:05.850 --> 04:08.250
♪ Again ♪

04:09.940 --> 04:12.260
♪ You outshine the stars ♪

04:12.900 --> 04:15.630
♪ And hold them in your palm ♪

04:16.000 --> 04:19.029
♪ Now we've made a way ♪

04:19.490 --> 04:22.910
♪ Now we're at the edge ♪

04:22.930 --> 04:24.930
♪ Tomorrow and today ♪

04:25.900 --> 04:28.320
♪ Now in every way ♪

04:28.350 --> 04:33.440
♪ The world draws still ♪

04:37.080 --> 04:42.470
♪ I wish for you ♪

04:43.330 --> 04:48.940
♪ I wish for you ♪

04:49.380 --> 04:54.650
♪ Look up at the moon
and reach for my hand ♪

04:54.890 --> 04:58.680
♪ Oh, I wish for you ♪

04:57.710 --> 05:05.620
[Outpatient]

05:07.830 --> 05:08.480
Recently,

05:08.630 --> 05:10.000
the case of Xincheng Stadium's collapse,

05:10.000 --> 05:11.950
which once attracted nationwide attention,

05:11.950 --> 05:13.000
has been reopened

05:13.000 --> 05:14.270
for investigation,

05:14.270 --> 05:16.230
revealing multiple
previously hidden details.

05:16.230 --> 05:18.510
The key evidence used to accuse

05:18.510 --> 05:21.000
Qin Yuze, the chief architect
of the Xincheng Stadium project,

05:21.000 --> 05:22.510
has been confirmed as forged,

05:22.510 --> 05:25.510
and he was not primarily responsible for
the accident.

05:25.510 --> 05:27.950
Pei Kanghua, the current chairman
of Forma Group,

05:27.950 --> 05:30.750
is now under police investigation
regarding issues related to

05:30.750 --> 05:33.270
the procurement of construction materials
for Xincheng Stadium.

05:33.270 --> 05:34.750
According to preliminary investigations,

05:34.750 --> 05:36.610
he is suspected of embezzlement,

05:36.920 --> 05:38.790
commercial bribery,

05:39.070 --> 05:40.960
major construction safety violations,

05:40.960 --> 05:41.950
evidence fabrication,

05:41.950 --> 05:43.310
illegal disclosure of information,

05:43.310 --> 05:44.390
and other charges.

05:45.390 --> 05:46.830
The police have
taken criminal detention measures

05:46.830 --> 05:49.520
against those involved
in accordance with the law.

05:49.520 --> 05:52.180
The case remains
under further investigation.

05:53.430 --> 05:56.159
Mr. Xiao's father's name
has finally been cleared.

05:56.159 --> 05:57.360
It's truly a miracle.

05:57.680 --> 05:58.430
Yeah,

05:58.830 --> 05:59.750
after 20 years.

06:00.120 --> 06:01.480
It really hasn't been easy.

06:01.480 --> 06:03.630
This should shut up the clients who were

06:03.630 --> 06:06.090
planning to
cancel their contracts with us.

06:07.480 --> 06:08.110
Of course.

06:09.800 --> 06:11.330
I'd like to inform everyone

06:11.950 --> 06:14.720
that the supplier information leak case
has been resolved.

06:14.720 --> 06:15.920
The investigation against us

06:15.920 --> 06:17.520
has been completely terminated.

06:17.520 --> 06:20.320
We can now resume work
on the Lanjing Park project.

06:20.660 --> 06:22.460
Was it really Pei Zhen who did it?

06:23.630 --> 06:24.510
He turned himself in,

06:24.510 --> 06:25.430
confessed to making false accusations,

06:25.430 --> 06:27.310
and accepted administrative penalties.

06:27.310 --> 06:28.430
I'll notify the legal department later

06:28.430 --> 06:30.090
to file a lawsuit against him.

06:30.310 --> 06:30.830
Right.

06:31.190 --> 06:32.920
He damaged our studio's interests

06:32.920 --> 06:34.390
and ruined Mr. Xiao's reputation.

06:34.390 --> 06:36.990
He should be held accountable for
his actions.

06:37.830 --> 06:38.310
Anyway,

06:38.310 --> 06:39.430
it's all over now.

06:39.560 --> 06:41.430
Everyone, get busy with
your current projects.

06:41.430 --> 06:42.690
While Mr. Xiao is away,

06:42.870 --> 06:44.400
we need to focus on our work.

06:44.860 --> 06:45.990
Get back to work now.

06:58.800 --> 06:59.270
Dad...

07:02.110 --> 07:03.600
It's finally over now.

07:06.400 --> 07:07.800
You can rest in peace now.

07:21.550 --> 07:25.020
[Qin Yuze]

07:26.680 --> 07:27.830
Hu Xiu told me

07:28.000 --> 07:29.260
you'd come here today.

07:32.680 --> 07:33.390
Zhiyu.

07:34.510 --> 07:35.510
You knew the truth

07:35.580 --> 07:37.110
when you were still a child,

07:37.430 --> 07:38.750
yet you never told me.

07:40.130 --> 07:41.180
I know.

07:42.430 --> 07:44.430
You were afraid I'd be heartbroken,

07:45.010 --> 07:47.070
and you were worried about my health.

07:49.159 --> 07:49.950
Back then...

07:52.390 --> 07:53.790
I only thought of myself,

07:53.830 --> 07:55.690
running away from what happened,

07:56.310 --> 07:58.000
but I left you to face it alone.

08:03.230 --> 08:04.760
Such a significant matter—

08:05.720 --> 08:06.980
I should've been there

08:07.370 --> 08:08.830
to see it through with you.

08:12.120 --> 08:14.520
You've already been with me
through it all.

08:16.680 --> 08:17.310
Mom.

08:18.480 --> 08:19.360
Thank you.

08:21.530 --> 08:22.760
Thank you for still choosing

08:22.760 --> 08:24.360
to stand by my side in the end.

08:30.560 --> 08:32.110
I should be thanking you.

08:34.909 --> 08:36.630
Thank you for persisting

08:38.549 --> 08:39.679
and never giving up.

09:21.910 --> 09:23.710
I've already filed for divorce.

09:24.390 --> 09:25.920
Once the paperwork is done,

09:25.960 --> 09:27.820
I still want to go back to America.

09:30.810 --> 09:32.020
I'll go back with you.

09:32.720 --> 09:35.250
Surely there's a lot
that needs to be handled.

09:37.270 --> 09:38.550
How are things going

09:39.080 --> 09:40.440
between you and Hu Xiu?

09:42.390 --> 09:43.120
Pretty good.

09:44.870 --> 09:45.790
She's the one?

09:49.600 --> 09:50.130
Alright.

09:50.670 --> 09:52.030
When you two pick a date,

09:52.550 --> 09:53.920
I'll definitely come back

09:53.920 --> 09:55.920
to arrange a proper wedding for you.

10:07.360 --> 10:08.200
Your parents

10:08.200 --> 10:10.460
know about Pei Kanghua's crimes, right?

10:10.540 --> 10:11.760
It's all over the Internet.

10:11.760 --> 10:13.420
It's hard not to know about it.

10:13.910 --> 10:14.640
How about you?

10:14.640 --> 10:16.170
How's your recovery going?

10:17.000 --> 10:18.080
I've been in bed for two weeks.

10:18.080 --> 10:19.000
What do you think?

10:19.000 --> 10:20.530
I'll come see you tomorrow.

10:21.550 --> 10:22.600
It's a deal then.

10:22.750 --> 10:24.750
Alright, I gotta go. I have a guest here.

10:24.750 --> 10:25.320
Bye-bye.

10:29.590 --> 10:30.830
Who said

10:31.310 --> 10:32.770
you could go out tomorrow?

10:35.080 --> 10:36.320
I've been lying here
for half a month already.

10:36.320 --> 10:37.440
I'm cooped up every day.

10:37.440 --> 10:39.120
You've pampered me so well

10:39.550 --> 10:41.390
that I've even gained two pounds.

10:41.390 --> 10:44.390
People might think I'm on bed rest
after giving birth.

10:46.320 --> 10:48.520
Taking care of you after you give birth?

10:50.670 --> 10:51.600
I can do that too.

10:54.270 --> 10:54.750
Stop it.

10:54.750 --> 10:55.880
I almost spilled it.

11:00.480 --> 11:01.790
Once you're fully recovered,

11:01.790 --> 11:03.450
I can leave with peace of mind.

11:04.120 --> 11:05.250
Where are you going?

11:06.790 --> 11:08.320
After my mom finalizes her divorce,

11:08.320 --> 11:09.440
I'll take her back to America.

11:09.440 --> 11:10.770
I'll be gone for a while.

11:14.790 --> 11:17.510
Spend more time with your mom
during this period.

11:17.510 --> 11:18.970
She definitely needs you.

11:28.750 --> 11:29.910
Before I leave,

11:29.910 --> 11:32.310
there's an important place
I need to visit.

12:11.000 --> 12:12.200
That's a lot of stuff!

12:12.390 --> 12:13.390
Let me help you carry some.

12:13.390 --> 12:15.030
What kind of boyfriend
would let his girlfriend carry things?

12:15.030 --> 12:15.690
I've got it.

12:21.150 --> 12:22.210
Then let me help you

12:22.270 --> 12:23.800
close the car door at least.

12:23.870 --> 12:24.240
Sure.

12:25.290 --> 12:27.150
Let's go. My parents are waiting.

12:29.390 --> 12:30.630
How do I look today?

12:45.360 --> 12:46.760
You do look a bit strange.

12:47.390 --> 12:47.920
Strange?

12:48.150 --> 12:48.880
Strange how?

12:49.880 --> 12:51.080
Strangely handsome.

13:00.790 --> 13:02.450
Are you wearing a new cologne?

13:14.390 --> 13:15.250
It smells nice.

13:16.990 --> 13:17.710
Hu Xiu!

13:22.390 --> 13:24.450
Bring him up since he's already here!

13:42.120 --> 13:42.720
Mom!

13:45.670 --> 13:46.470
Coming!

13:49.320 --> 13:50.200
Yu, you're here!

13:50.200 --> 13:50.510
Auntie.

13:50.510 --> 13:51.440
Come in, come in quickly.

13:51.440 --> 13:53.170
He's brought you lots of gifts.

13:53.630 --> 13:55.090
Just brought a few things.

13:55.720 --> 13:56.750
These are for you.

13:57.200 --> 13:58.530
And these are for Uncle.

13:59.550 --> 14:00.550
"Just a few?"

14:01.440 --> 14:02.250
Oh my dear,

14:02.280 --> 14:04.160
why did you buy so many things?

14:04.750 --> 14:05.840
If you're too formal with him,

14:05.840 --> 14:07.200
he'll feel awkward.

14:09.200 --> 14:09.730
Alright.

14:09.870 --> 14:11.200
Then I'll accept them.

14:11.720 --> 14:12.980
I'm glad you like them.

14:13.860 --> 14:14.740
Hu,

14:14.900 --> 14:15.850
he's here!

14:20.720 --> 14:22.200
Wasn't Dad just here calling for us?

14:22.200 --> 14:24.460
Why did he go back into the bedroom again?

14:24.960 --> 14:26.160
He's putting on airs.

14:28.790 --> 14:29.340
Uncle.

14:31.910 --> 14:33.170
Have a seat on the sofa.

15:02.240 --> 15:03.920
I've already seen the news.

15:17.870 --> 15:18.390
Uncle,

15:19.200 --> 15:19.790
I came here specifically

15:19.790 --> 15:21.270
to apologize to you.

15:23.360 --> 15:24.670
When I started dating Hu Xiu,

15:24.670 --> 15:26.440
I didn't tell her who I really was.

15:26.440 --> 15:29.700
I planned to tell her everything
once things were settled.

15:29.910 --> 15:31.240
But I never expected...

15:36.080 --> 15:37.410
If I had said it earlier,

15:38.320 --> 15:39.960
that car accident wouldn't have happened.

15:39.960 --> 15:41.760
You wouldn't have had to suffer.

15:42.250 --> 15:44.380
And Hu Xiu wouldn't have been so upset.

15:52.960 --> 15:54.290
It's not all your fault.

15:55.390 --> 15:57.120
You had your difficulties too.

16:04.900 --> 16:06.090
And thanks to you,

16:07.480 --> 16:09.030
we finally got the truth.

16:11.340 --> 16:11.870
Alright.

16:13.200 --> 16:14.040
Let bygones

16:14.390 --> 16:15.200
be bygones.

16:19.510 --> 16:19.790
Do...

16:19.790 --> 16:21.850
Do you know how to play Chinese chess?

16:23.030 --> 16:23.760
A little bit.

16:24.070 --> 16:25.400
Play a few games with me.

16:25.510 --> 16:26.910
I'll teach you properly.

16:27.720 --> 16:28.150
Sure.

16:29.080 --> 16:29.510
Okay.

16:42.120 --> 16:42.550
You...

16:43.180 --> 16:45.510
You really didn't know how to play before?

16:45.600 --> 16:46.060
Wait...

16:46.750 --> 16:48.510
W-Were you just humoring me?

16:48.510 --> 16:49.600
You just won again.

16:50.240 --> 16:51.910
That's because you taught me well.

16:51.910 --> 16:53.440
Again. Let's have another round.

16:53.440 --> 16:54.840
Dinner will be ready soon.

16:54.840 --> 16:56.120
Have some fruit first.

17:00.230 --> 17:01.400
If you keep winning,

17:01.550 --> 17:03.810
my dad will play with you until tomorrow.

17:04.490 --> 17:06.420
I can't just lose on purpose, can I?

17:06.510 --> 17:07.599
What if he notices?

17:08.790 --> 17:10.750
Just bring out a tenth of
the acting skills you use

17:10.750 --> 17:12.150
in murder mystery games.

17:23.910 --> 17:24.720
Last month,

17:24.880 --> 17:26.740
your mother went back to the lane.

17:30.310 --> 17:31.590
I didn't know that.

17:31.920 --> 17:33.780
She waited for you for a long time.

17:33.910 --> 17:35.570
Where did you stay that night?

17:42.880 --> 17:43.350
I...

17:48.440 --> 17:50.570
Neither of you is getting any younger.

17:50.590 --> 17:51.510
I understand.

17:52.200 --> 17:54.130
What are your plans for the future?

17:54.640 --> 17:56.160
Have you two discussed
when you'll get engaged?

17:56.160 --> 17:58.110
D-Dad, why are you asking about that?

17:58.110 --> 17:58.680
Uncle,

17:59.400 --> 18:00.310
please rest assured.

18:00.310 --> 18:01.680
I'll take responsibility for Hu Xiu.

18:01.680 --> 18:03.510
And in the future,
I'll definitely marry Hu...

18:03.510 --> 18:05.170
This is quite sweet. Try some.

18:08.750 --> 18:10.440
That's exactly
what I wanted to talk to you about.

18:10.440 --> 18:12.790
Dad, can you please
stop being so old-fashioned?

18:12.790 --> 18:13.880
We haven't been dating that long.

18:13.880 --> 18:16.070
And you keep talking about
engagement and marriage.

18:16.070 --> 18:17.470
That's a lot of pressure.

18:18.600 --> 18:19.830
I don't feel pressured.

18:19.830 --> 18:20.550
Anyway, just stay out of it.

18:20.550 --> 18:21.680
We have our own pace.

18:22.680 --> 18:23.310
Besides,

18:23.430 --> 18:25.440
my career is just starting to take off.

18:25.440 --> 18:28.100
I don't have any thoughts
about marriage at all.

18:31.000 --> 18:32.800
All right, I'm going to help Mom.

18:43.590 --> 18:44.250
Checkmate.

19:13.200 --> 19:14.600
What are you looking for?

19:15.160 --> 19:16.220
Where's the candy?

19:18.200 --> 19:18.590
Here.

19:22.790 --> 19:23.750
It's for you.

19:23.960 --> 19:25.310
You drank so much just now.

19:25.310 --> 19:27.240
Having something sweet will help.

19:41.310 --> 19:42.310
My dad,

19:42.310 --> 19:44.510
once he starts drinking, he can't stop.

19:45.270 --> 19:48.270
You don't have to take drinking with him
so seriously.

19:51.750 --> 19:53.010
You did drink too much.

20:37.350 --> 20:38.800
I don't feel like taking a taxi home.

20:38.800 --> 20:40.540
I'll just stay at your place tonight.

20:40.540 --> 20:41.680
You can take my car.

20:41.680 --> 20:43.480
I won't need it tomorrow anyway.

20:51.110 --> 20:51.960
Nope.

20:52.160 --> 20:54.090
I'm staying at your place tonight.

20:59.920 --> 21:01.350
I'll wear your loungewear.

21:01.350 --> 21:02.440
I've been meaning to buy

21:02.440 --> 21:06.170
some loungewear and slippers
to leave here, but I keep forgetting.

21:32.270 --> 21:33.030
What?

21:33.860 --> 21:35.130
When it comes to relationships,

21:35.130 --> 21:36.330
I'm a serious person.

21:36.850 --> 21:38.380
W-Who's not being serious?

21:38.390 --> 21:39.110
Obviously,

21:39.790 --> 21:40.350
it's you.

21:41.310 --> 21:41.790
Me?

21:45.490 --> 21:46.690
Are you mad?

21:47.400 --> 21:48.800
What did my dad say to you?

21:49.720 --> 21:50.200
That doesn't make sense.

21:50.200 --> 21:52.200
When you two left, the vibe was fine.

21:54.790 --> 21:56.850
It has nothing to do with your father.

21:57.720 --> 21:59.000
Then what is it?

22:03.830 --> 22:04.960
Fine, don't tell me.

22:07.530 --> 22:10.990
What do you mean by "having no thoughts
about marriage at all"?

22:14.550 --> 22:16.440
I only said that

22:16.440 --> 22:18.270
to help you out.

22:18.550 --> 22:21.610
Otherwise, my dad would've
interrogated you for ages.

22:22.790 --> 22:23.440
I understand

22:23.440 --> 22:24.440
your dad's concerns,

22:24.440 --> 22:25.700
and I can address them.

22:26.460 --> 22:28.120
You have so little faith in me?

22:28.160 --> 22:29.160
Of course not.

22:29.680 --> 22:32.270
You're the person
I have the most faith in.

22:37.720 --> 22:38.590
So...

22:39.060 --> 22:40.510
that wasn't what you really meant?

22:40.510 --> 22:41.590
I meant it.

22:42.260 --> 22:45.190
It really is too early for us
to discuss those things.

22:47.200 --> 22:47.880
What?

22:47.950 --> 22:49.320
The master bedroom is
for the lady of the house.

22:49.320 --> 22:52.050
The lady with no plans
can sleep in the guest room.

22:55.980 --> 22:57.110
You're getting old.

22:58.440 --> 23:00.300
And your temper's getting worse.

23:20.640 --> 23:22.640
I can't sleep in my regular clothes!

23:22.800 --> 23:25.130
Can I wear your bathrobe you left outside?

23:26.720 --> 23:27.310
Go ahead.

23:34.830 --> 23:35.830
Come out quickly!

23:35.840 --> 23:36.880
There's a

23:36.960 --> 23:39.200
super, super, super big spider
in the bathroom!

23:39.200 --> 23:40.200
It's terrifying.

23:55.070 --> 23:55.660
Three,

23:56.350 --> 23:56.880
two,

23:57.800 --> 23:58.320
one.

24:01.310 --> 24:02.310
0.9,

24:02.720 --> 24:03.880
0.8,

24:04.830 --> 24:05.790
0.7...

24:22.790 --> 24:23.310
Three,

24:24.310 --> 24:24.830
two,

24:25.790 --> 24:26.270
one.

24:26.720 --> 24:28.030
Xiao Zhiyu,

24:28.030 --> 24:29.640
we're out of toothpaste.

24:31.070 --> 24:33.330
I can't sleep without brushing my teeth.

24:35.200 --> 24:35.880
Who is it?

24:36.680 --> 24:38.130
Convenience store delivery!

24:38.130 --> 24:39.790
You just ordered toothpaste!

25:24.480 --> 25:25.110
Gotcha.

25:28.000 --> 25:28.680
Don't go.

25:41.320 --> 25:42.800
So you still care about me.

25:46.350 --> 25:47.350
Still mad?

25:50.750 --> 25:53.070
I just want to talk to you.

25:54.550 --> 25:55.480
Will you listen?

26:01.270 --> 26:02.470
These past few years,

26:03.120 --> 26:05.920
my life has felt like
following a preset template—

26:06.920 --> 26:08.440
pursuing

26:08.750 --> 26:10.150
a "stable" relationship

26:10.720 --> 26:12.200
or a "secure" job.

26:13.970 --> 26:15.450
In the end,

26:16.230 --> 26:17.720
I couldn't satisfy others

26:18.400 --> 26:20.030
or make myself happy either.

26:23.980 --> 26:25.700
Until I met you.

26:27.400 --> 26:28.660
Only then did I realize

26:29.200 --> 26:31.310
what kind of life

26:31.750 --> 26:32.640
and future

26:33.250 --> 26:34.340
I truly want.

26:38.400 --> 26:41.130
I chose my career path again—
one I actually like.

26:42.070 --> 26:43.720
And then I met you.

26:44.830 --> 26:45.690
Because of you,

26:46.790 --> 26:49.400
I have more courage to chase my dreams

26:50.480 --> 26:52.140
and make up for all my regrets.

26:55.960 --> 26:56.920
So...

27:11.550 --> 27:12.350
I understand.

27:15.440 --> 27:17.640
Whatever plans you have for the future,

27:18.960 --> 27:20.760
I'll support you as much as I can.

27:22.920 --> 27:24.200
I just hope

27:25.960 --> 27:27.350
your plans include me.

27:29.590 --> 27:31.200
You're not part of my plans.

27:33.750 --> 27:36.030
You're already written into my life.

27:40.720 --> 27:42.180
Finally, you're smiling.

27:42.440 --> 27:43.440
That wasn't easy.

27:44.480 --> 27:45.270
So,

27:45.270 --> 27:46.930
can I borrow your pajamas now?

27:51.550 --> 27:52.270
Xiao Zhiyu.

28:21.680 --> 28:23.480
You're not wearing shoes again.

28:23.600 --> 28:25.460
What are you secretly looking at?

28:26.880 --> 28:28.590
One of Ms. Zhou's projects.

28:28.830 --> 28:30.960
The client wants to design
a community cultural center

28:30.960 --> 28:32.200
based on the very popular concept

28:32.200 --> 28:34.060
of a "community art living room."

28:35.110 --> 28:37.510
I'm reviewing the client's requirements.

28:40.550 --> 28:41.480
Ms. Zhou said

28:42.240 --> 28:43.920
if I can secure this project,

28:44.030 --> 28:46.000
she'll let me lead it.

28:47.030 --> 28:48.030
She's testing me.

28:51.590 --> 28:52.750
I need to figure it out myself.

28:52.750 --> 28:53.750
Don't interfere.

28:54.790 --> 28:56.200
I haven't said a word yet.

28:56.960 --> 28:59.930
As a family member, you should know
when to step aside.

28:59.930 --> 29:00.660
Understand?

29:01.830 --> 29:02.890
"A family member"?

29:07.960 --> 29:08.550
Fine.

29:11.550 --> 29:13.400
Then can this family member

29:13.960 --> 29:16.960
give me some independent creative space?

29:18.460 --> 29:19.790
Go, please.

29:21.270 --> 29:22.110
Come on, go.

29:23.200 --> 29:23.640
Go.

30:05.680 --> 30:06.830
You can use the study.

30:06.830 --> 30:09.430
You don't look comfortable
sitting like that.

30:10.310 --> 30:11.030
No, thanks.

30:11.550 --> 30:12.720
That chair of yours

30:13.070 --> 30:14.240
fits your figure,

30:14.590 --> 30:16.110
but it doesn't suit me.

32:06.960 --> 32:07.790
Being more comfortable

32:07.790 --> 32:09.450
helps you think more clearly.

32:17.680 --> 32:18.920
Let's meet.

32:23.880 --> 32:24.680
What's wrong?

32:26.720 --> 32:27.400
Pei Zhen.

32:28.270 --> 32:29.270
He wants to see me.

32:40.030 --> 32:41.160
Let's play together,

32:41.160 --> 32:41.590
Qin...

32:44.270 --> 32:45.070
Xiao Zhiyu.

32:55.150 --> 32:55.670
Here.

33:00.950 --> 33:01.720
You go first.

33:24.000 --> 33:24.790
It's okay.

33:25.020 --> 33:26.190
We can start over.

34:15.320 --> 34:15.980
She's fine.

34:23.230 --> 34:24.630
How is your mother doing?

34:28.480 --> 34:29.480
She's doing fine.

34:31.510 --> 34:33.510
So you came to see me just to ask that?

34:39.110 --> 34:41.190
Forma recently held a board meeting.

34:43.000 --> 34:45.260
I've decided to change the company name.

34:47.360 --> 34:48.320
I just found out

34:49.400 --> 34:50.710
that your father

34:51.000 --> 34:52.110
chose the name.

34:53.000 --> 34:54.330
Continuing to use it...

34:55.070 --> 34:56.929
just doesn't feel right anymore.

34:59.960 --> 35:01.710
The process will take some time.

35:01.710 --> 35:03.440
Once I'm done with everything,

35:03.440 --> 35:04.700
I'll leave this place.

35:12.330 --> 35:14.190
You're just letting go like that?

35:14.590 --> 35:15.400
No regrets?

35:21.720 --> 35:22.780
All these years...

35:25.360 --> 35:27.620
I've always wanted to beat you just once.

35:28.110 --> 35:30.310
When we were young, it was about grades.

35:31.630 --> 35:33.890
When we grew up, it was about the company.

35:34.720 --> 35:35.630
Later on...

35:45.030 --> 35:47.030
I even wanted to outdo you in hatred.

35:48.800 --> 35:50.000
But it turns out, you never

35:50.000 --> 35:51.200
even saw me as a rival.

35:53.190 --> 35:54.320
Pretty ridiculous,

35:55.230 --> 35:55.880
isn't it?

36:01.440 --> 36:03.170
What are your plans after this?

36:07.230 --> 36:08.160
I don't know yet.

36:10.670 --> 36:12.670
But someone once told me—

36:14.510 --> 36:17.440
what ultimately determines
what a building becomes

36:17.510 --> 36:18.770
isn't the foundation,

36:19.760 --> 36:21.110
but your own vision.

36:25.880 --> 36:27.150
I'll go look for that.

36:34.960 --> 36:35.840
Xiao Zhiyu.

36:38.630 --> 36:40.830
We probably won't see each other again.

36:54.800 --> 36:55.550
I'm sorry.

37:02.670 --> 37:03.730
For everything...

37:06.320 --> 37:07.920
everything I did to you.

37:12.000 --> 37:12.800
I'm sorry.

37:38.360 --> 37:39.110
Goodbye.

38:29.690 --> 38:32.850
♪ Fireworks scatter across the sky ♪

38:33.220 --> 38:37.350
♪ And the faint light in my eyes
fades with them ♪

38:39.300 --> 38:42.600
♪ Just like the end of our story ♪

38:42.880 --> 38:44.770
♪ Who says ♪

38:45.430 --> 38:49.800
♪ We meet just to say goodbye? ♪

38:50.630 --> 38:55.570
♪ Who's to blame for a fate like this? ♪

38:56.970 --> 38:59.720
♪ Walking across ♪

39:00.920 --> 39:06.470
♪ This hollow bridge of fate ♪

39:05.230 --> 39:05.920
Ms. Hu!

39:07.750 --> 39:12.970
♪ If you can't see the other shore,
just look up ♪

39:09.590 --> 39:11.850
If the foundation has already been laid,

39:12.360 --> 39:13.150
does that mean construction

39:13.150 --> 39:14.840
can only follow the original blueprints,

39:14.210 --> 39:16.420
♪ Only a few stars shine ♪

39:15.920 --> 39:17.650
with no possibility of change?

39:17.740 --> 39:20.910
♪ It's true ♪

39:18.510 --> 39:19.770
But it's not absolute.

39:20.110 --> 39:21.710
Even if the foundation is completed,

39:21.290 --> 39:24.570
♪ I miss you ♪

39:22.230 --> 39:24.670
as long as the load distribution
isn't altered,

39:24.630 --> 39:30.870
♪ Hope the night brings me to you ♪

39:24.670 --> 39:27.530
you can still modify
a building's exterior design.

39:27.800 --> 39:31.060
So what ultimately decides
a building's final appearance

39:31.550 --> 39:32.410
isn't the foundation,

39:32.410 --> 39:35.050
♪ And I also know ♪

39:33.400 --> 39:34.530
but your own vision.

39:35.650 --> 39:42.000
♪ The night will pass
and I have to part with you ♪

39:42.720 --> 39:50.900
♪ It's hard to accept but true ♪

40:00.510 --> 40:03.150
♪ And I also know ♪

40:03.600 --> 40:09.950
♪ The dreams are false
and I should forget you ♪

40:10.580 --> 40:20.060
♪ It's hard to accept but true ♪
